<title>USA: SOS Staffing buys consultancy firm.</title>
<headline>SOS Staffing buys consultancy firm.</headline>
<dateline>SALT LAKE CITY 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>SOS Staffing Services Inc said Monday it agreed to buy Telecom Project Assistance Inc, a California management consultancy firm, for an undisclosed sum of cash.</p>
<p>Telecom, based in Mountain View, posted annual revenues of about $3 million, SOS said in a statement. SOS said it expected to retain Telcom's employees after completing the deal.</p>
<p>SOS posted net earnings of $0.15 per share for the quarter ended March 31, compared with $0.11 in 1996. The firm's shares opened unchanged at 14-1/4 today.</p>
<p>((New York Newsdesk 212 859 1610))</p>
